<div class="container mt-4">
    <h3 class="mb-4 fw-bold text-primary">
        <i class="bx bx-receipt"></i> Purchase 테이블 총괄 관리 (Admin)
    </h3>
    
    <table class="table table-bordered border-primary table-hover align-middle" style="text-align: center; font-size: 0.95rem;">
        <thead class="table-primary">
            <tr>
                <th style="width: 8%;">고객ID</th>
                <th style="width: 8%;">고객명</th>
                <th style="width: 7%;">상품ID</th>
                <th>상품명</th>
                <th style="width: 15%;">구매일</th>
                <th style="width: 9%;">단가</th>
                <th style="width: 6%;">포인트</th>
                <th style="width: 6%;">구매량</th>
                <th style="width: 10%;">총가격</th>
                <th style="width: 7%;">지불여부</th>
                <th style="width: 7%;">취소여부</th>
                <th style="width: 7%;">수정</th>
                <th style="width: 7%;">삭제</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <% if (results && results.length > 0) { %>
                <% results.forEach((p) => { %>
                    <tr>
                        <td><code><%= p.loginid %></code></td>
                        <td class="fw-bold text-secondary"><%= p.user_name %></td>
                        <td><%= p.prod_id %></td>
                        <td class="text-start text-truncate" style="max-width: 150px;"><%= p.prod_name %></td>
                        <td><small><%= p.date %></small></td>
                        <td><%= p.price.toLocaleString() %>원</td>
                        <td><span class="badge bg-light text-primary border border-primary">+<%= p.point %></span></td>
                        <td><span class="badge bg-secondary"><%= p.qty %>개</span></td>
                        <td class="fw-bold text-danger"><%= p.total.toLocaleString() %>원</td>
                        
                        <td>
                            <% if (p.payYN === 'Y') { %>
                                <span class="badge bg-success">결제완료</span>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark">미결제</span>
                            <% } %>
                        </td>
                        
                        <td>
                            <% if (p.cancel === 'Y') { %>
                                <span class="badge bg-danger">주문취소</span>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <span class="badge bg-outline-primary text-primary border border-primary">정상</span>
                            <% } %>
                        </td>
                        
                        <td>
                            <a href="/purchase/purchaseupdate/<%= p.purchase_id %>" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-success px-2" style="text-decoration: none;">
                                <i class="bx bx-edit"></i> 수정
                            </a>
                        </td>
                        
                        <td>
                            <a href="/purchase/delete_process?admin=Y&purchase_id=<%= p.purchase_id %>" 
                               class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger px-2" 
                               style="text-decoration: none;" 
                               onclick="return confirm('관리자 권한으로 해당 주문 내역을 데이터베이스에서 완전히 삭제하시겠습니까?');">
                                <i class="bx bx-trash"></i> 삭제
                            </a>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                <% }) %>
            <% } else { %>
                <tr>
                    <td colspan="13" class="py-5 text-muted">
                        <i class="bx bx-info-circle fs-3"></i><br>
                        시스템에 등록된 전체 사용자 구매 내역 데이터가 존재하지 않습니다.
                    </td>
                </tr>
            <% } %>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="mt-3 text-end">
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary px-3">
            <i class="bx bx-home"></i> 메인화면으로 복귀
        </a>
    </div>
</div>